 nal 2 km controlled\, not fast.\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 10 km.
 \n\nFueling:\n- eat carbs the night before and before the run\; add elect
 rolytes if warm.\n\nRecovery:\n- calves\, quads\, hip flexors\, and gentl
 e knee-friendly range work.\n- protein plus a large carb meal within 2 ho
 urs.
