SUMMARY:Calisthenics Density + Zone 2
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3500 kcal\, 165 g protein\, 505 g carbs\, 1
 00 g fat\nCategory: gym\nRun volume: 4 km\nAdjustments:\n- Adjusted for s
 chedule constraints.\n- Back-friendly loading ramp.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5 min 
 easy cardio\, shoulder prep\, hip mobility\, and crawling patterns.\n\nMa
 in Work:\n- Progression: double progression by adding clean reps before a
 dding time or load\; cap the density block at RPE 8. Reduce volume by 25-
 40% before adding intensity. Low-back ramp: start lightly and add load on
 ly when the next morning is symptom-free.\n- Density block: 20 min altern
 ating pull-ups\, push-ups\, inverted rows\, and hanging knee raises at 2 
 RIR.\n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 4 km conversational immediately after or in the
  morning.\n- Carry finisher: suitcase carry 3 x 30 m per side at RPE 7.\n
 \nOptional:\n- lateral raises or curls 2 x 15-20 at RPE 8 if time remains
 . Low-back ramp: no deadlifts or hyperextensions\; start lightly and keep
  supported posterior-chain work pain-free.\n\nRun:\n- Planned running vol
 ume: 4 km.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, a
 nd place carbohydrates before and after training.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep w
 indow stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.
