 ported rows: 4 x 6-10 at RPE 8 paired with goblet squat 3 x 8-12 at RPE 7
 .\n- Core finisher: farmer carries 3 x 40 m at RPE 7 plus dead bug 2 x 8 
 per side. Keep carries light and skip them if the low back feels loaded. 
 Low-back ramp: no deadlifts or hyperextensions\; start lightly and keep s
 upported posterior-chain work pain-free.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\
 , keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and after tra
 ining.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if j
 oints feel stiff.
